{"3328840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Timefront", "steam_appid": 3328840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/998152682c8af0aa19ea375447fc1532.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/0d9b37cd86e82980438a03b403a28921.poster.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1170 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/0d9b37cd86e82980438a03b403a28921.webm?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/0d9b37cd86e82980438a03b403a28921.mp4?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage all-out war in 8-player free-for-all on a battlefield that changes over time. Try new races, commander, units, abilities and artifacts in your Loadout to find your preferred playstyle. There are endless combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b253beb1650cd0a8efa95c56526501d5.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.poster.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.webm?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.mp4?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield shrinks! You and surviving players are forced to fight for what little resources and space is left. Will you position yourself strategically early to defend to the last or will you build up your army and economy to raze everything in your path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/be310ffbe3fe3bd1ae6dc7f919cafd8f.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four races with vastly different units, commanders, bonuses and buildings: the Eldmen, the Travelers, the Ironfolk and the Rogdakar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Timefront forces your hand by locking areas of play as time advances. Plan ahead or risk being frozen in time for Eternity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match gives you new ways to shape your faction. Combine racial traits, techs, commanders, units, abilities and artifacts to create wildly different armies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your economy by capturing new territory. Your income increase with each province under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/843457733fc84acc687ae24ce4ef7ebf.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.poster.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.webm?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.mp4?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Eternity itself to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This single-player, roguelite campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b790360c09c0056f3d87772b7cd76787.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.poster.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.webm?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.mp4?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. Join an awesome community of creators and get rewarded for your time and effort!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/998152682c8af0aa19ea375447fc1532.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/0d9b37cd86e82980438a03b403a28921.poster.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1170 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/0d9b37cd86e82980438a03b403a28921.webm?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/0d9b37cd86e82980438a03b403a28921.mp4?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage all-out war in 8-player free-for-all on a battlefield that changes over time. Try new races, commander, units, abilities and artifacts in your Loadout to find your preferred playstyle. There are endless combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b253beb1650cd0a8efa95c56526501d5.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.poster.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.webm?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.mp4?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield shrinks! You and surviving players are forced to fight for what little resources and space is left. Will you position yourself strategically early to defend to the last or will you build up your army and economy to raze everything in your path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/be310ffbe3fe3bd1ae6dc7f919cafd8f.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four races with vastly different units, commanders, bonuses and buildings: the Eldmen, the Travelers, the Ironfolk and the Rogdakar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Timefront forces your hand by locking areas of play as time advances. Plan ahead or risk being frozen in time for Eternity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match gives you new ways to shape your faction. Combine racial traits, techs, commanders, units, abilities and artifacts to create wildly different armies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your economy by capturing new territory. Your income increase with each province under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/843457733fc84acc687ae24ce4ef7ebf.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.poster.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.webm?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.mp4?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Eternity itself to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This single-player, roguelite campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b790360c09c0056f3d87772b7cd76787.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.poster.avif?t=1787253377\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.webm?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.mp4?t=1787253377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. Join an awesome community of creators and get rewarded for your time and effort!</p>", "short_description": "A unique blend between RTS and battle royale, where you recruit units, expand your territory and battle other armies through a shrinking battlefield in a fight to be the last commander standing. Try this refreshing take on the RTS genre.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/f839eeb1999044ae469c236129427a31256ca4f3/header.jpg?t=1787253377", "capsule_image": "h